  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Charif Souki is an American energy entrepreneur who built substantial wealth through Cheniere Energy and later co-founded Tellurian. Educated at Colgate and Columbia, he worked in investment banking before developing liquefied natural gas businesses. He chairs Ajax Holdings, his family's private investment company, whose activities include property, hospitality and energy.",
